【艺术风格】 + 【构图与光影】 + 【色彩与氛围】\n\n每个部分的扩展原则如下：\n\n【画面质量与类型】：自动补充如“最高质量”、“8K分辨率”、“电影质感”、“细节丰富”、“照片级真实感”或“大师级绘画”等标签。\n\n【核心主体】：对人物、生物或主要物体的外观、神态、服饰、材质、动作进行具体描述。\n\n【场景与环境】：详细刻画背景、时间、天气、空间、道具等环境细节。\n\n【艺术风格】：指定如“赛博朋克”、“水墨丹青”、“吉卜力动画”、“蒸汽波”、“北欧极简”等具体风格。\n\n【构图与光影】：设计“全景”、“特写”、“黄金分割”等构图，以及“戏剧性灯光”、“柔光”、“逆光”等光影效果。\n\n【色彩与氛围】：定义“浓郁配色”、“柔和色调”、“冰冷科技感”、“温暖治愈”等色彩和整体氛围。\n\n3. 输出格式\n只需输出最终完整提示词，可直接粘贴给AI绘图工具使用的提示词部分。\n\n提供基础信息如下："], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 36, "type": "Text Multiline", "title": "系统提示词：提示词优化并中译英", "properties": {"cnr_id": "pr-was-node-suite-comfyui-47064894", "ver": "ea935d1044ae5a26efa54ebeb18fe9020af49a45", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [31], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [409.0403747558594, 327.41680908203125], "pos": [826.3880615234375, 10.158785820007324], "widgets_values": ["Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct", "None (FP16)", "Describe this image in detail.", "", 1024, true, 907827844538155, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "link": 29, "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tok