e furniture is a plain wall painted in a soft neutral tone, likely beige or pale gray.\n- Natural daylight filters through sheer curtains to the side, illuminating the scene evenly without harsh shadows.\n\nOverall, the composition conveys warmth, comfort, and domestic tranquility. The cat’s candid expression adds humor and charm—a perfect snapshot of feline life at home."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 2, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 22}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [2, 42], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [409.0403747558594, 327.41680908203125], "pos": [616.2471313476562, -752.3500366210938], "widgets_values": ["Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct-FP8", "None (FP16)", "Describe this image in detail.", "", 1024, true, 470982012549446, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 1, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_